          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="2451ab48">In your Command phase, if the bearer is on the battlefield, you gain 1CP. In addition, the bearer can issue 2 additional Orders to Regiment units in your Command phase. (Default enhancement; may be replaced with Intimidating Presence (Aura): In your Command phase, if the bearer is on the battlefield, you gain 1CP. In addition, while a friendly Regiment unit is within 6" of the bearer's unit: Each time a model in this unit makes a ranged attack, re-roll a Hit roll of 1 and re-roll a Wound roll of 1.)</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
